  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.000" end="00:03.370" ttm:agent="v1">Aqui na DZ7, o bagul' tem que ser assim</p>
      <p begin="00:03.370" end="00:05.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">7, o bagu—, 7, o bagu—, 7, o bagu—, 7, o bagu— (Hul, vapo, toma, toma)</p>
      <p begin="00:05.520" end="00:07.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">7-7-7, o bagu—, 7, o bagu—, 7, o bagu— (Vem, vem, vem, vem)</p>
      <p begin="00:07.370" end="00:11.060" ttm:agent="v1">Hul, vapo, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:11.060" end="00:14.710" ttm:agent="v1">Hul, vapo, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:14.710" end="00:18.450" ttm:agent="v1">Hul, vapo, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:18.450" end="00:22.010" ttm:agent="v1">Hul, vapo, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:22.010" end="00:24.210" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta do my thing, runnin' solo, no pack</p>
      <p begin="00:24.210" end="00:25.970" ttm:agent="v1">Havin' nightmares where everything fade to black</p>
      <p begin="00:25.970" end="00:27.670" ttm:agent="v1">I told my girl, &quot;Hold up, I'll be right back&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:27.670" end="00:29.650" ttm:agent="v1">Steady smokin' out and then I make a dope track</p>
      <p begin="00:29.650" end="00:31.540" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no, ain't no, race, that's, ga-ga-ga-game</p>
      <p begin="00:31.540" end="00:33.300" ttm:agent="v1">She ain't lo—, she ain't lo—, with your, chan-chan-chan-change</p>
      <p begin="00:33.300" end="00:35.120" ttm:agent="v1">I told my girl, I told my girl, —d up, ri-ri-ri-right</p>
      <p begin="00:35.120" end="00:36.980" ttm:agent="v1">Steady s—, steady s—, then I m—, then I m—, do-do-do-dope</p>
      <p begin="00:36.980" end="00:38.800" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no, ain't no, race, that's, ga-ga-ga-game</p>
      <p begin="00:38.800" end="00:40.760" ttm:agent="v1">She ain't lo—, she ain't lo—, with your, chan-chan-chan-change</p>
      <p begin="00:40.760" end="00:42.580" ttm:agent="v1">I told my girl, I told my girl, —d up, ri-ri-ri-right</p>
      <p begin="00:42.580" end="00:44.310" ttm:agent="v1">Steady s—, steady s—, then I m—, then I m—, do-do-do-dope</p>
      <p begin="00:44.310" end="00:47.990" ttm:agent="v1">Toma, toma, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:47.990" end="00:51.700" ttm:agent="v1">Hul, vapo, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:51.700" end="00:55.180" ttm:agent="v1">Hul, vapo, toma, toma, vem, vem, vem, vem</p>
      <p begin="00:55.180" end="00:57.270" ttm:agent="v1">Run low on change, but I gotta come up</p>
      <p begin="00:57.270" end="00:58.990" ttm:agent="v1">I be hustlin', sun down to sun up</p>
      <p begin="00:58.990" end="01:00.750" ttm:agent="v1">Loafs on my face, stackin' money bigger</p>
      <p begin="01:00.750" end="01:02.610" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta get it all, never slip through my fingers</p>
      <p begin="01:02.610" end="01:04.660" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no, ain't no, race, that's, ga-ga-ga-game</p>
      <p begin="01:04.660" end="01:06.450" ttm:agent="v1">She ain't lo—, she ain't lo—, with your, chan-chan-chan-change</p>
      <p begin="01:06.450" end="01:08.280" ttm:agent="v1">I told my girl, I told my girl, —d up, ri-ri-ri-right</p>
      <p begin="01:08.280" end="01:10.130" ttm:agent="v1">Steady s—, steady s—, then I m—, then I m—, do-do-do-dope</p>
      <p begin="01:10.130" end="01:11.940" ttm:agent="v1">Ain't no, ain't no, race, that's, ga-ga-ga-game</p>
      <p begin="01:11.940" end="01:13.940" ttm:agent="v1">She ain't lo—, she ain't lo—, with your, chan-chan-chan-change</p>
      <p begin="01:13.940" end="01:15.730" ttm:agent="v1">I told my girl, I told my girl, —d up, ri-ri-ri-right</p>
      <p begin="01:15.730" end="01:17.460" ttm:agent="v1">Steady s—, steady s—, then I m—, then I m—, do-do-do-dope</p>
      <p begin="01:17.460" end="01:21.000" ttm:agent="v1">Aqui na, aqui na, aqui na, aqui na DZ7, o bagul' tem que ser assim</p>
